### Cost Optimization Opportunities
- Reserved instances vs on-demand (30-60% savings for committed usage)
- Spot/preemptible instances for batch jobs
- Auto-scaling to avoid over-provisioning
- Storage tiering (hot → warm → cold)
- Startup credits (AWS Activate, GCP for Startups, Azure for Startups)

